608
00:54:36,523 --> 00:54:37,384
bir kere

609
00:54:37,384 --> 00:54:39,163
izimlerden yani

610
00:54:39,163 --> 00:54:41,703
Marksizm, sosyalizm gibi

611
00:54:41,703 --> 00:54:42,783
